-- against the RawProd MAIN database as the owner (DDL/DML) role. Never instead of this: pnpm db:seed.
-- New permission codes (5): production:oil_batch_balance:read, production:oil_batch_remnant:write, production:oil_batch:write_off, production:floor_mix:reveal_name, masterdata:material_import:write
